# Clinic System - Test Project

This is a test Django project for a small rural clinic. 

## Purpose
- To build a basic skeleton for managing patients, visits, diagnoses, medications, and staff accounts.
- Intended as a learning project for a second-year computer science student.
- Designed to be later migrated to a full production environment.

## Technology
- Python 3.x
- Django 4.x
- SQLite (for local testing)

## Notes
- This repository is currently for coding and testing purposes.
- Deployment, multi-user live database, and cloud setup are out of scope for now.

